These files document the padding failure of the first extension
attempt.  slabs_neg8_ext.json (committed at repo root) is the
original defective input, generated 13:01 local with gen_slabs
default pads.  failed_pads_slab0.log and failed_pads_slab0.json here
were produced at 11:22:01Z as a post-audit reproduction run of that
seed's first slab: every inward check returns a zero-centered ball
and the certifier exits FAIL in seconds.  gen8v2.log is the
regeneration walk that replaced it (complete 10:35:39Z); smoke3.log
is the three-point pre-launch smoke of the corrected file.
